      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUMBLE SMILES (8) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 340m at this track in a respectable 19.18 on October 6. Expected to go close again if runs up to latest time. FLASH JET (2) has a terrific record here with two wins and three placings from five starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (22.48) in a NG last time at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. WOOLGOOLGA LASS (4) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 5.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.62 beating Sassy Crossed. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Must be included in calculations. KOORINGA EXPRESS (5) will have admirers after surprising many with a placing last time out.",
